			"author": "tvwatcherdenver",
			"rating": 8,
			"provider_id": 1,
			"content": "I like cooking competition shows, this one is the best.  None of the contrived drama and BS of most American shows (and you can almost guarantee there will be an American version of this soon enough).  Such skilled bakers, I wish I could bake like that!  Not a fan of the new man-baby host but otherwise it's a solid show."
		},
